  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Thinly slice capsicum.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and 1/2 the garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Transfer to a small bowl. Stir in Greek-style yoghurt. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548f947f254b51716951/step-33bfab00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, until tender, 5-6 mins.\n• Add the water and stock powder and bring to the boil.\n• Stir in couscous. Cover and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548f947f254b51716951/step-2080c610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pat haloumi dry and cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil and cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.\n• Remove from heat, add the honey and dried oregano (see ingredients) and turn to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548f947f254b51716951/step-76bb6f20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, toss spinach & rocket mix with a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide capsicum couscous and salad between bowls.\n• Top with sweet herby haloumi and drizzle over garlic yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548f947f254b51716951/step-1deffd30.jpg"
    }
  ]
